{"id":"temple-of-kruphix","name":"Temple of Kruphix","type":"location","aliases":["Kruphix's true temple"],"description":"Kruphix's true temple at the edge of the world, with two great trees overlooking a waterfall that borders Nyx.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2014-06-11","last_seen":"2014-06-11","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e3","summary":"Kydele feels dead inside and finds that Kruphix, who had spoken to her constantly, has fallen silent since Heliod's betrayal.","participants":["kydele","kruphix"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":33,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":35,"quote":"But since Heliod's act of betrayal, the voice of her god had fallen silent.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=But%20since%20Heliod%27s%20act,god%20had%20fallen%20silent.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=But%20since%20Heliod%27s%20act,god%20had%20fallen%20silent.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id"