.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=So%20was%20the%20triton%E2%80%94the,the%20ire%20of%20Thassa.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=So%20was%20the%20triton%E2%80%94the,the%20ire%20of%20Thassa.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e8","summary":"Kruphix explains that Xenagos traveled to godless worlds and tried to show everyone the gods were a lie, but people saw only chaos and he threatened nothing.","participants":["kruphix","kydele","xenagos"],"location":"temple-of-kruphix","importance":"minor","page":"stories/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","order":33,"story_date":"2014-06-11","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":109,"quote":"decided everyone on Theros should know the gods were a lie.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=decided%20everyone%20on%20Theros,gods%20were%20a%20lie.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kruphix's Insight","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-06-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11#:~:text=decided%20everyone%20on%20Theros,gods%20were%20a%20lie.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kruphix's Insight\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Jun 2014."}},{"id":"kruphixs-insight-2014-06-11-e9","summary":"Kruphix reveals his fear: threats from the Eldrazi, an ancient drago